Package: emburdenlca
Title: Life-Cycle Assessment Factor Service for the emburden Ecosystem
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Eric", "Scheier", , "info@emburden.org", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6628-1389"))
Description: Supply-chain + operational embodied-energy and embodied-emissions
    factor service for the emburden ecosystem. Loads USEEIO v2 (US) and
    EXIOBASE (global) input-output tables, serves per-sector emergy and
    greenhouse-gas factors to the Phase 6 LCA attachment step of
    emburdensynth, and provides ecoinvent / Brightway2 parity hooks for
    process-based LCA. Spun out from emburdensynth so a single factor
    service can be shared by every ecosystem consumer (household footprint
    pipeline, Compute Carrying Capacity solver for hyperscale data-center
    siting, global synthesis Joule-target manuscript).
